#: ../../index.md:3
msgid ""
"Cette documentation s'adresse à deux publics distincts — choisissez votre"
" section selon votre rôle."
msgstr ""
"This documentation targets two distinct audiences — pick the section "
"that matches your role."

#: ../../index.md:6
msgid ""
"**Agent** — design et fonctionnement interne : architecture, API HTTPS, "
"configuration, sécurité de production."
msgstr ""
"**Agent** — internal design and operation: architecture, HTTPS API, "
"configuration, production security."

#: ../../index.md:9
msgid ""
"**Workload SDK** — développer et déployer une application embarquée : "
"écrire le code métier, lire la configuration runtime, produire l'artefact"
" OTA."
msgstr ""
"**Workload SDK** — developing and deploying an embedded application: "
"writing business logic, reading runtime configuration, producing the "
"OTA artifact."

#: ../../index.md:32
msgid ""
"L'agent implémente le contrat "
"[`embewi`](https://iobewi.github.io/embewi/) (`v1alpha1`) : piloté par un"
" contrôleur Kubernetes ([embewi-core](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi-"
"core)) via une API HTTPS authentifiée, il gère les OTA A/B avec selfcheck"
" borné et rollback automatique, et émet heartbeat et logs vers le Core."
msgstr ""
"The agent implements the [`embewi`](https://iobewi.github.io/embewi/) "
"contract (`v1alpha1`): driven by a Kubernetes controller "
"([embewi-core](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi-core)) over an "
"authenticated HTTPS API, it handles A/B OTA with a time-bounded "
"self-check and automatic rollback, and emits heartbeat and logs to the "
"Core."

#: ../../index.md:54
msgid "Repères"
msgstr "Reference points"

#: ../../index.md:56
msgid ""
"**Dépôt** : [iobewi/embewi-agent-esp](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi-"
"agent-esp) (code source, build, tests, partitions)."
msgstr ""
"**Repository**: [iobewi/embewi-agent-esp](https://github.com/iobewi/"
"embewi-agent-esp) (source code, build, tests, partitions)."

#: ../../index.md:58
msgid ""
"**Contrat Core ↔ Agent** : "
"[iobewi.github.io/embewi](https://iobewi.github.io/embewi/) "
"(spécification normative `v1alpha1`, rattachée en submodule `contract/`)."
msgstr ""
"**Core ↔ Agent contract**: "
"[iobewi.github.io/embewi](https://iobewi.github.io/embewi/) (normative "
"`v1alpha1` specification, attached as the `contract/` submodule)."

#: ../../index.md:60
msgid ""
"**Chips supportés** : ESP32-C3 (testé). Compatible C6, S3, H2 (même "
"famille RISC-V)."
msgstr ""
"**Supported chips**: ESP32-C3 (tested). Compatible with C6, S3, H2 "
"(same RISC-V family)."
